# Substack publishing drafts (scripts/export-for-substack.py output): article
# text + chart/map PNGs, one subfolder per investigation slug, colocated with
# each investigation for easy browsing. Working files for pasting into
# Substack, not site assets — must stay out of the repo since GitHub Pages
# serves everything that's committed here. Matches subfolders only, so the
# investigations/*.html pages themselves stay tracked.
investigations/*/
